OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse prevention orders a
OL,4,A'step in right direction'              
OL,6,FA charity has welcomed the rollout of  
OL,7,Fdomestic abuse protection orders       
OL,8,F(DAPOs) across England and Wales but   
OL,9,Fwarned more needs to be done to protect
OL,10,Fand support victims.                   
OL,12,FUnder new restrictions, abusers could  
OL,13,Fbe forced to hand over house keys,     
OL,14,Fsocial media passwords, phones and     
OL,15,Flaptops in a bid to protect victims.   
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
