OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4   
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse prevention orders a
OL,4,A'step in right direction'              
OL,6,FJill Caldwell, chief executive of      
OL,7,FBolton-based domestic abuse charity    
OL,8,FEndeavour, said the rollout was "a     
OL,9,Freally good start" but the government  
OL,10,Fneeded to ensure the orders were       
OL,11,Feffectively enforced by police and     
OL,12,Fspecialist support services were in    
OL,13,Fplace for victims.                     
OL,15,FHome Secretary, Shabana Mahmood, said  
OL,16,Fthe government was "rolling out the    
OL,17,Fstrongest protections ever available to
OL,18,Fvictims".                              
